10 REM FILES.BAS: OPEN (READ, WRITE, APPEND), CLOSE, PRINT#, INPUT#,
11 REM GET#, EOF, FOUR CHANNELS AT ONCE, SAVE: FILES WRITTEN, READ BACK
20 N$="FILES"
100 OPEN 1,"F1.TXT","W":PRINT #1,"LINE ONE":PRINT #1,42
